Foreground yes
LogTime yes
TCPSocket 3310
TCPAddr 0.0.0.0
User clamav
DatabaseDirectory /var/lib/clamav
LocalSocket /tmp/clamd.sock
MaxThreads 2
MaxQueue 4
ReadTimeout 300
CommandReadTimeout 30
StreamMaxLength 2048M
MaxScanSize 2048M
MaxFileSize 2048M
MaxRecursion 16
MaxFiles 1000
AlertExceedsMax yes
